{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"31a7cffc895a6a7e","type":"text","text":"## Ranger - ranged path\nPhysical ranged path of character class that relies on ranged combat witth slingshots/bows\nevery player that has chosen this class immedietly recieves weapon handling in  ranged light weapon type and roll d4 to determine their starting proficieny as is said in weapon handling note\n\nat level 8 player rolls a d6 to determine which class they'll get as following:\n1 or 4 - [[Archer]]\n2 or 5 - [[Hunter]]\n3 or 6 -[[Gunslinger]]\n\nif they reject the first offer at level 12 they roll again and choose as folowing:\n if first was hunter:\n odd - [[Archer]]\n even -[[Gunslinger]]\n if first was archer:\n odd -[[Hunter]]\n even - [[Gunslinger]]\n if first was crossbow:\n odd - [[Archer]]\n even - [[Hunter]]\n and they still can choose the path they had rejected previously\n\nif the second offer is not to the player's liking at level 16 they can choose the thiord option or the two previous ones if they changed their mind","x":-220,"y":-220,"width":502,"height":235,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"fc7ad3692bbefc63","type":"text","text":"# Punch\n1lvl character class recomanded for players  that just started playing rpg games, for players that played opther games and have expirience with role playing games it's suggested to start immedietly from lvl 4 and choose one of the following ","x":-169,"y":-547,"width":400,"height":187},
		{"id":"e284160fc058a86d","type":"text","text":"## Adept - magical path\n\nmagical path if character class that relies on combat with magic\nevery player that has chosen this class immedietly recieves weapon handling in  magical small weapon type and roll d4 to determine their starting proficieny as is said in weapon handling note\n\nat level 8 player rolls a d6 to determine which class they'll get as following:\n1 or 4 - Sage\n2 or 5 - Veterian\n3 or 6 -Mage\n\nif they reject the first offer at level 12 they roll again and choose as folowing:\n if first was veterian:\n odd - Sage\n even -Mage\n if first was chemist:\n odd -Veterian\n even - Mage\n if first was mage:\n odd - Sage\n even - Veterian\n and they still can choose the path they had rejected previously\n\nif the second offer is not to the player's liking at level 16 they can choose the thiord option or the two previous ones if they changed their mind","x":380,"y":-782,"width":540,"height":235,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"f0424854e861bce8","type":"text","text":"## Sword - melee path\nat level 8 player rolls a d6 to determine which class they'll get as following:\n 1 or 4 - Barbarian\n 2 or 5 - Ninja\n 3 or 6 - Knight\n\nif they reject the first offer at level 12 they roll again and choose as folowing:\n if first was ninja:\n odd - Barbarian\n even -Knight\n if first was barabarian:\n odd -Ninja\n even - Knight\n if first was knight:\n odd - Barbarian\n even - Ninja\n and they still can choose the path they had rejected previously\n\n if the second offer is not to the player's liking at level 16 they can choose the thiord option or the two previous ones if they changed their mind\n\n\n\n","x":-840,"y":-782,"width":513,"height":235,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"71487455684643dc","type":"text","text":"### Barbarian\nPhysical melee path of character class that relies on close combat with bashing long weapon and slashing long weapon \nevery player that has chosen this class immedietly recieves weapon handling in bashing long weapon and slashing long weapon  and roll d4 to determine their starting proficieny as is said in weapon handling note\n\n\nwhen chosen this class it starts to be really important what does barbarinn focus his willpower on\nat level 20 the player checks which one of them has the most invested out of those three and recievs one of the classes:\n- Dealing damage/raging Berserker\n- influance on others emotion  Bard\n- Convincing others Commander\n\nthey can reject it and choose the desired one if fate dice turns to player's favour (8)","x":-781,"y":-1280,"width":395,"height":157,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"3f7cca8d5324a930","type":"text","text":"# Archer\nArcher is focused on Light ranged weapon\n\nwhen chosen this class it starts to be really important what does the player invests while fighting\nat level 20 the player checks which one of them has the most invested out of those three and recievs one of the classes:\n\n- Distance/precision Longbow\n- Magic Magical Archer\n- High Damage Crossbow\n\nthey can reject it and choose the desired one if fate dice turns to player's favour (8)","x":-166,"y":379,"width":395,"height":158,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"f2bd025165b7d6da","type":"text","text":"# Mage\nMage is a class based on magic and casting spells/rituals/elemental bending\n\nwhen chosen this class it starts to be really important what type of magic do a player master. There are three types of magic that can be mastered.\nat level 20 the player checks which one of them has the most invested in those three and recievs one of the classes:\n\n- Elemental Magic - Sorcerer\n- symbol magic - Warlock\n- written magic - Wizard\n\nthey can reject it and choose the desired one if fate dice turns to player's favour (8)\n","x":453,"y":-1280,"width":395,"height":157,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"b5d2a6926a2799de","type":"text","text":"### Knight\nPhysical melee path of character class that relies on close combat with long sword and shields\nevery player that has chosen this class immedietly recieves weapon handling in long slash weapon and living small type and roll d4 to determine their starting proficieny as is said in weapon handling note\n\n\nwhen chosen this class it starts to be really important what does motivate your goals\nat level 20 the player checks which one of them has the most invested out of those three and recievs one of the classes:\n\n- ideaology Paladin\n- selfimprovement Samura\n- protection something/someone Guardian\n\n\nthey can reject it and choose the desired one if fate dice turns to player's favour (8)\n","x":-1640,"y":-960,"width":393,"height":178,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"254e4539889521e0","type":"text","text":"# Veterinarian\nVaterinarians are the ones who specializes in nature wolrd and focus on how magic interact with flora and fauna\n\nwhen chosen this class it starts to be really important what do a player interact the most with.\nat level 20 the player checks which one of them has the most invested in those three and recievs one of the classes:\n\n- Fauna Zoologist\n- Spiritual world Shaman\n- flora  Druid\n\nthey can reject it and choose the desired one if fate dice turns to player's favour (8)\n","x":1360,"y":-932,"width":395,"height":150,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"50cd3c86fe98df68","type":"text","text":"# Gunslinger\nGunslinger is the class that operates on firearms and gunpower\n\nwhen chosen this class it starts to be really important what do a player uses the most of\nat level 20 the player checks which one of them has the most invested out of those three and recievs one of the classes:\n\n- Bounties Bounty Hunter\n- experimental weapons Engineer\n- Heavy ranged weapon  Marksman\n\nthey can reject it and choose the desired one if fate dice turns to player's favour (8)\n","x":400,"y":160,"width":395,"height":158,"color":"5"},
