		{"id":"c52cc6dc58c5e61c","type":"text","text":"### Ninja\nPhysical melee path of character class that relies on close combat with bashing short weapon and throwable weapons\nevery player that has chosen this class immedietly recieves weapon handling in bashing short weapon and throwable type and roll d4 to determine their starting proficieny as is said in weapon handling note\n\nwhen chosen this class it starts to be really important how player gathers information\nat level 20 the player checks which one of them has the most invested out of those three and recievs one of the classes:\n- informations/investigation [[Spy]]\n- Stalking [[Shadow]]\n- stealing [[Rouge]]\nthey can reject it and choose the desired one if fate dice turns to player's favour (8)\n","x":-1515,"y":-585,"width":395,"height":158,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"820644d279c34f22","type":"text","text":"# Spy","x":-1482,"y":-255,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"faca72b1e1cdcc5c","type":"text","text":"# Tropic master","x":-1472,"y":160,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"c1c6ebb345e2a198","type":"text","text":"# Dart Shooter","x":-1082,"y":59,"width":250,"height":83,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"5a125dbb234c53e9","type":"text","text":"# Sage\nTake a look into more scientific part of the world, using magic as a scientifc tool than a weapon, their focus lands on preparation rather than combat itself\n\nwhen chosen this class it starts to be really important what do a player create the most of.\nat level 20 the player checks which one of them has the most invested in those three and recievs one of the classes:\n\n- Potions Chemist\n- Scientific  Scientist\n- Magical Items Artificer\n\nthey can reject it and choose the desired one if fate dice turns to player's favour (8)\n","x":1281,"y":-500,"width":405,"height":150,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"e9c2c2f307cf9b81","type":"text","text":"# Archmage","x":130,"y":-1903,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"283a56ccf51ef867","type":"text","text":"# Hunter\nHunter that focuses on hunting in his familiar regions. Focuses on finding weak spots in prey and using it to take it down.\n\nwhen chosen this class it starts to be really important where do a player spends the most time in\nat level 20 the player checks which one of them has the most invested out of those three and recievs one of the classes:\n\n\n- Standard enviroment Trapper\n- Seas and water masses Pirate\n- Exotic cliamtes Tube shooter\n\nthey can reject it and choose the desired one if fate dice turns to player's favour (8)\n\n","x":-686,"y":160,"width":395,"height":158,"color":"5"},
